The 'mcpServers' folder contains configuration files that define server connections for MCP (Model Control Protocol) services used in the project. The shattered-archive-mcp-server.yaml file specifically configures the connection to a Shattered Archive MCP server, establishing how the application communicates with this particular server instance. This folder serves as the central location for all MCP server configurations, enabling the project to dynamically connect to different server endpoints as needed.
